Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.40,0:22:51.83,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Let the winds of heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.83,0:22:53.39,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Blow through the paths among the clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.39,0:22:54.68,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,And close their gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.68,0:22:56.72,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Then for a while I could detain
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.72,0:22:58.60,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,These messengers in maiden form.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.56,0:23:01.88,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for listening!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.88,0:23:02.84,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.00,0:23:06.71,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,My tooth is falling out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.71,0:23:10.32,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It will fall out soon, Daikichi. {It's really hard to understand this voice :p}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.90,0:23:13.00,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:17.56,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The next story, and the last story, is "The First Step."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.25,0:23:19.18,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:49.22,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ashita no koto wa wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:52.64,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kore tte gisei to wa chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:54.34,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nanika ga chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:57.96,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}batsu ge-mu ja nante omowanai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.96,0:01:01.21,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}de nande na no ka wa wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.21,0:01:04.61,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}chotto shakuzen to shinai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.61,0:01:10.16,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi no sonzai ima daiji da nante mon ja nai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.66,0:01:16.42,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}owaranai koto nante kono yo no doko ni mo nai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.53,0:01:20.97,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}naku no wa tsurain ja nai no
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.97,0:01:23.67,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ai no Sweet Drops, Sweet Drops
