Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.11,0:01:30.24,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}motto yasashiku shitai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:34.00,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi to iraretara Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:37.22,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}onna no ko tte tsuyoi ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.22,0:01:40.53,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}dakedo tokidoki yowai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.89,0:01:47.22,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}bokura no negai wa Happy Happy Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.22,0:01:50.66,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}sonna hibi mo Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.10,0:01:58.37,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:49.22,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}We don't know what'll happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:52.64,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This feels different from a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:54.34,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Something feels different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:57.96,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm not thinking of it as a punishment game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.96,0:01:01.21,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I still don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.21,0:01:04.61,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though I don't quite feel satisfied with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.61,0:01:10.16,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}there's no question that you're important to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.66,0:01:16.42,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}There's nothing in this world that's endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.53,0:01:20.76,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Isn't it painful having to cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.97,0:01:23.56,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Love's sweet drops, sweet drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.67,0:01:27.11,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to keep dreaming forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.11,0:01:30.24,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to be kinder?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:34.00,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}As long as I'm with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:37.22,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you think girls can be strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.22,0:01:40.53,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though we can be weak sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.89,0:01:47.22,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our wish is for happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.22,0:01:50.66,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Those days can also be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.10,0:01:58.37,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:59.32,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nichiyou no hareta hirusagari
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:02.85,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kyou wa doko e yukou?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:09.81,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kayoi nareta itsumo no michi ga
