Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:19.76,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}terasu atatakai taiyou to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.78,0:21:24.84,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}tonari ni kimi ga ireba
