Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.51,0:21:34.79,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}hashagidasu kimochi ni
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.15,0:21:39.36,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:45.67,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe wa dokomademo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.67,0:21:49.83,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
