Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.83,0:22:09.37,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe mo tobihaneru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:59.32,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}It's a sunny Sunday, early in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:02.85,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Where should we go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:09.81,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This path I've grown so used to taking
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.81,0:21:14.41,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}seems to be shining brightly,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:19.76,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}as long as the warm sun is shining
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.78,0:21:24.84,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}and you are here beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:28.92,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.51,0:21:34.79,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I feel like frolicking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.15,0:21:39.36,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:45.67,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our voices can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.67,0:21:49.83,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.49,0:21:55.45,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm riding on the rising wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.14,0:22:00.31,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.83,0:22:09.37,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even our voices will be bouncing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.57,0:00:09.65,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.65,0:00:10.86,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you bite your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:15.99,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's my tooth...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:17.62,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's wobbly...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:18.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:20.83,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:24.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You've got a permanent tooth coming in from the bottom,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:26.29,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,so just leave it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:29.25,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want your rice as porridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:32.67,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No, it'll be fine if I eat slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:19.80,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.43,0:02:21.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.06,0:02:29.77,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.90,0:02:33.44,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Look, there's my drawing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.49,0:02:41.62,Main Dialog,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, your dad always comes to these things, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:42.16,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:44.87,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Although he's not my dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.87,0:02:46.54,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,He's not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:50.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh. It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:52.17,Main Dialog,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You know what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.17,0:02:55.38,Main Dialog,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan's the best at drawing in Class B!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:57.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't say...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:03:00.68,Main Dialog,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I bet you could become a mangaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.26,0:03:02.26,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.26,0:03:04.43,Main Dialog,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure you could!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:12.52,Main Dialog,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:14.15,Main Dialog,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:20.86,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:24.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This guy with the clothes and the hair is her dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.57,0:03:26.08,Main Dialog,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,How handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:27.24,Main Dialog,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:29.04,Main Dialog,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}He's so tall!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:32.58,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You know what? Sayaka-chan's father is 31, the same age as you, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.38,0:03:34.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:38.32,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Really? What a happy coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.63,0:03:43.93,Main Dialog,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,My papa does modeling!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.55,0:03:45.64,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:47.97,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Now, Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.97,0:03:49.60,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:51.64,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,When I was younger...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:57.77,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I think I may have seen you before in my company's catalog...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:03:59.82,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.11,0:04:02.49,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.49,0:04:04.49,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't mind my asking, what's the name of your company?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.95,0:04:08.79,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,That may be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:10.54,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I'm much obliged!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.71,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Cheerful guy, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:12.71,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Now I'm embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.71,0:04:15.79,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,These days, I'm a manager for the same agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:17.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.67,0:04:20.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like kind of a waste...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.05,0:04:23.30,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,It's the kind of work where you can't really predict the hours or income,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:26.18,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,so when my daughter was born, I had to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:27.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.51,0:04:33.27,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,At that time, I was drinking almost every night and complaining about work...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.27,0:04:34.85,Main Dialog,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Mi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:38.02,Main Dialog,Mi-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Nabe-chin! Long time no see!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:41.11,Main Dialog,Mi-chan,0000,0000,0000,,We were classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.11,0:04:42.44,Main Dialog,Mi-chan,0000,0000,0000,,We're both from the same neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:45.61,Main Dialog,Mi-chan,0000,0000,0000,,He's got a boy in Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.07,0:04:49.28,Main Dialog,Mi-chan,0000,0000,0000,,This is Rin-chan's father, Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:51.04,Main Dialog,Mi-chan,0000,0000,0000,,He's the same age as we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:53.25,Main Dialog,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah? Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:54.71,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.08,0:04:59.63,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,These two are the type that protect their kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:00.96,Main Dialog,Rib,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.09,0:05:06.97,Main Dialog,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a butcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.97,0:05:08.68,Main Dialog,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,My shop's on the corner of the shopping district.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:11.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin and I often get take-out croquettes there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.35,0:05:13.77,Main Dialog,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Really? That makes me feel good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.77,0:05:15.02,Main Dialog,Mi-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Me too! Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:16.69,Main Dialog,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,I know, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:27.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I made fellow father-friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.93,0:05:59.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,In a sense, the world may be wider here...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:07.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.61,0:06:09.78,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:12.08,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's suddenly turned cold, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:13.12,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:16.04,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It seems the kids are already in the gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:18.21,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I just hope he has his jacket on...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:19.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.33,0:06:23.59,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, he's quite the artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:25.13,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:27.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, you can tell he took a lot of time on it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:35.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You know what, all the kids are in the gym already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:37.68,Main Dialog,Nobu,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:40.98,Main Dialog,Nobu,0000,0000,0000,,Crap! My teacher's gonna get mad at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.98,0:06:43.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Something I don't like about boys...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.73,0:06:46.69,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, how adorable! How many months?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.69,0:06:48.86,Main Dialog,Mother with Child,0000,0000,0000,,Almost 10 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:52.70,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I love babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.58,0:06:55.49,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Makes me feel nostalgic...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:07:02.00,Main Dialog,MotherA,0000,0000,0000,,Well, my kid had the flu last week...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:02.58,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I'm sorry I've kept you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:04.71,Main Dialog,MotherB,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really? That must've been rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.58,0:07:03.92,Main Dialog,Mother with Child,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.71,0:07:06.34,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is it that season already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.34,0:07:09.05,Main Dialog,MotherB,0000,0000,0000,,With that, they have to stay home for two days even if the fever's down, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.05,0:07:09.88,Main Dialog,MotherB,0000,0000,0000,,So it doesn't spread...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:14.60,Main Dialog,MotherA,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but I sent him to school right after his temperature went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.06,0:07:16.64,Main Dialog,MotherB,0000,0000,0000,,Well, what else could you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:18.56,Main Dialog,MotherB,0000,0000,0000,,You don't want to get fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.56,0:07:22.94,Main Dialog,MotherA,0000,0000,0000,,Right, and he was getting better, so the virus was probably weakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:24.19,Main Dialog,MotherB,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:28.80,Main Dialog,MotherA,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, even if he did pass it on, nobody would ever know who did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:34.03,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:48.84,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Um... What those mothers were talking about kind of hit home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.84,0:07:52.43,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,And that makes me even more depressed...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.93,0:07:56.56,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Like about work. I can relate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.56,0:07:58.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.85,0:08:03.23,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,When it gets cold out, I become a nervous wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.23,0:08:05.15,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,But Kouki, the way he is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.77,0:08:07.98,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Put your pajamas on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.03,0:08:14.87,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,But once winter passes and it starts to get warm out,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.87,0:08:16.91,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll finally breathe a sigh of relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.95,0:08:19.87,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:28.25,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, I'll go get my satchel, so wait here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:30.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you two dummies?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:31.55,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, your nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.55,0:08:34.59,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's cold in the gym, which is why I told you to wear your jacket!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.59,0:08:35.97,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And don't run in the halls!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.97,0:08:37.30,Main Dialog,Kouki and Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.89,0:08:40.06,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I said don't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:46.15,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki's baby teeth are already starting to come out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.15,0:08:47.65,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,We live in an apartment complex,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:49.69,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,so throwing teeth onto the roof doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:53.53,Main Dialog,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Note: Lower baby teeth are thrown onto the roof as a charm\Nto make the permanent bottom teeth come in straight
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.15,0:08:53.90,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Recently, he hasn't been listening to me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:57.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I don't have room to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.99,0:08:59.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I used to wear the absolute minimum,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:02.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and I'd run down the stairs full speed, skipping every other step...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.45,0:09:06.25,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'd wolf down lunch, drink milk in one gulp...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:10.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It feels really weird telling kids not to do everything that {\i1}I{\i0} did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:14.09,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You did all that, Daikichi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.09,0:09:16.93,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I think it's relatively normal for a boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:20.60,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I don't think of Kouki as just another kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.81,0:09:23.85,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.85,0:09:27.35,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,But if you were like that too, Daikichi-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:29.77,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,it makes me feel a little relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.66,0:09:39.83,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? Walk with Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.83,0:09:40.91,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.91,0:09:44.54,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Then let's split into a boys' team and a girls' team!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:45.62,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.17,0:09:49.75,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Is Rin-chan's face a little flushed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:57.43,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I think she has a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.14,0:10:01.60,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It might get higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:07.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's a lot more flushed than usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.87,0:10:20.37,Main Dialog,Doctor,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's not the flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.29,0:10:24.31,Main Dialog,Doctor,0000,0000,0000,,For now, please have all of the family members wear a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.21,0:10:26.25,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.84,0:10:28.34,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's good news, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.34,0:10:29.26,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.05,0:10:37.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:41.06,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:45.23,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... I don't feel right around here...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.23,0:10:49.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The doctor said it was the stomach flu, so you don't have to force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.07,0:10:51.94,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... I feel kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.40,0:10:54.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.07,0:10:56.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-Washbowl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.93,0:11:19.39,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin does?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.39,0:11:21.35,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Call an ambulance right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.35,0:11:24.56,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, I already had her checked out by a doctor and we got medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:26.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but she won't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.35,0:11:28.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Her fever keeps climbing higher and she looks like she's miserable...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.69,0:11:31.15,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I bet you had her wear light clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.15,0:11:33.03,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, that's irrelevant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.99,0:11:35.57,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Did you try mixing the medicine in with juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.95,0:11:39.20,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,You always drank it right away if it was mixed with something sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:42.08,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:43.29,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.13,0:11:54.51,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Here, just try a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.51,0:11:55.47,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.05,0:11:58.01,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, just a spoonful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.89,0:12:04.48,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.71,0:12:34.46,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for coming so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:36.63,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How's Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:38.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.26,0:12:38.89,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,May I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.89,0:12:42.10,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Daikichi, what's with that hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:41.18,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.27,0:12:46.77,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She doesn't have the flu, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.85,0:12:50.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, go watch TV over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:51.27,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.27,0:12:52.29,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Quietly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.69,0:12:58.53,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She finally fell asleep a little while ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:05.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Her fever keeps rising...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.95,0:13:08.12,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And it seems like she's not able to sleep much...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:10.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's not sweating at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.17,0:13:12.38,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Has she been able to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.29,0:13:16.80,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I was told to at least give her sports drinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.80,0:13:19.18,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but she won't eat or drink anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.18,0:13:20.93,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.47,0:13:24.43,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.56,0:13:28.31,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You can't get flustered!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.27,0:13:35.19,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,The adult has to stay calm and tell her it's going to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.15,0:13:37.65,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:39.86,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I've never seen Rin like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.41,0:13:42.84,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's not hard! You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:45.95,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,When a child is in real trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:48.79,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,an adult who will help needs to be by their side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.38,0:13:56.42,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan will be fine as long as you're there, Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.18,0:14:03.78,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.93,0:14:07.52,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.52,0:14:09.48,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You must be thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.48,0:14:11.19,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Want to try sucking on some ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.41,0:14:28.54,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:34.04,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:36.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! You're up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:38.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, I was in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:39.80,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:42.80,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:47.81,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,In a little while, suck on some more ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.81,0:14:50.98,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,If you have it all at once, you'll surprise your tummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:52.62,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.90,0:15:00.53,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I just put something sweet and yummy in the fridge for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.65,0:15:02.70,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.37,0:15:12.16,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. You'll be late for work, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:14.64,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan is really doing her best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:18.13,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,If you're here for her, she'll be okay, Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.59,0:15:21.59,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.63,0:15:24.80,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You too, Kouki. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.80,0:15:25.55,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:35.27,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. I might have to take off tomorrow, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:37.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If something comes up, give me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.19,0:15:38.19,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.86,0:15:40.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for the trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.78,0:15:42.69,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.69,0:15:44.86,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Please, leave everything to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:45.99,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:00.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Can you eat a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:01.30,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.43,0:16:13.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,When you have a cold, you get to eat all these sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.27,0:16:20.06,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.03,0:16:33.83,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You'll get better after a bit more rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.96,0:16:43.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:46.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If I'd gotten it, it'd be nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.76,0:16:47.84,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.84,0:16:50.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:11.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:13.12,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.12,0:17:14.54,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:16.12,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.67,0:17:26.26,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How do you feel, Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.26,0:17:27.72,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Does it hurt anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.51,0:17:30.30,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.26,0:17:34.39,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to make you some yummy rice gruel now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:53.91,Main Dialog,Daisuke,0000,0000,0000,,Her fever's gone up again since this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.91,0:17:55.33,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.33,0:17:59.12,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Even normal temperatures are lower in the morning and rise in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:02.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But earlier it was higher than 39 degrees...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.50,0:18:04.71,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Here, put this in the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:06.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.51,0:18:10.09,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.05,0:18:16.64,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.06,0:18:22.65,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Water...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:32.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That looks good...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.07,0:18:34.37,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I made it for you too, Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:39.04,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Rin wants water!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.04,0:18:40.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:48.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, I don't want you catching it, so stay in this room, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.63,0:18:51.63,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind getting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.63,0:18:53.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You can't mean that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.56,0:19:04.06,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.28,0:19:15.78,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.78,0:19:19.01,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, when you're here, Rin feels totally at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.58,0:19:21.54,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:28.88,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Here, Rin-chan. Eat a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.76,0:19:36.26,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry. When Kouki gets sick, he eats this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.26,0:19:38.81,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's specially made gruel that helps you get better fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:42.02,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun does too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.02,0:19:43.23,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.23,0:19:47.23,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Whenever he ate this, his cold was gone before I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.07,0:19:59.45,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:08.71,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.51,0:20:23.93,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Are you better?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.85,0:20:28.60,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I feel fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.75,0:20:47.25,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.93,0:22:24.68,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Will you tell your mom thank you for the other evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.60,0:22:29.02,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She looked after Rin, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.64,0:22:33.40,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, can I go home with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.40,0:22:35.06,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.06,0:22:38.40,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Your mom has to be the one who picks you up from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.78,0:22:42.78,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See, my mom is sick in bed with a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:45.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Are you serious?!
